      "rationale": "The gate accepts strictly more than before and only in one case: two bare dates one day apart. Every spec that passed still passes. Instants and mixed instant/date pairs keep exact comparison, pinned by two test cases. No stamp the engine writes changes, so repositories and CI keep recording the same dates."
